#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/components.md:8
msgid ""
"Taxonomy and placement rules for Portal UI. Implementation lives under `src/"
"ui-kit/` and `src/features/*/ui/`. Agent import bans → [`.agent/rules/"
"frontend-ui.md`](../../.agent/rules/frontend-ui.md) and [`.agent/rules/"
"frontend-features.md`](../../.agent/rules/frontend-features.md)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/components.md:10
msgid ""
"Visual tokens → [foundations.md](foundations.md). Dimension axes → "
"[dimensions.md](dimensions.md)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ui/components.md:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Spoken terms → repository terms"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/components.md:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Spoken (product/design)         | Repository term                                                                      | Typical home                  |\n"
"| ------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | ----------------------------- |\n"
"| Non-business / design-system UI | **Primitive**, **structure**, **composite**                                          | `@freeanima/ui-kit`           |\n"
"| Business / product UI           | **Domain** UI                                                                        | `src/features/<slug>/ui`      |\n"
"| UI component                    | A React building block at one of the layers above                                    | —                             |\n"
"| UI element / slot piece         | Presentational part inside a pattern (title text, badge, icon) — not its own package | Inside a component or pattern |\n"
"| App chrome                      | **app frame** (not Shell)                                                            | `src/client/app-frame`        |\n"
"| Host                            | **Shell**                                                                            | `src/portal/app/*`            |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ui/components.md:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Layers"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/components.md:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Layer         | Role                                                                                                | Location                       |\n"
"| ------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n"
"| **Primitive** | shadcn/Radix controls + variants (`Button`, `Dialog`, `Input`, …)                                   | `ui-kit/components/ui`         |\n"
"| **Structure** | Form and layout shells (`FormFieldset`, `ListDetailLayout`, viewport hooks)                         | `ui-kit/form`, `ui-kit/layout` |\n"
"| **Composite** | Cross-feature interaction patterns (`ConfirmDialog`, `ActionSheet`, `ContextMenu`, `EmptyState`, …) | `ui-kit/composite`             |\n"
"| **Domain**    | Product-specific screens and fields                                                                 | `features/<slug>/ui`           |\n"
"| **app frame** | Module rail / tabs / settings host                                                                  | `client/app-frame`             |\n"
"| **Shell**     | Portal host, IPC, bridge                                                                            | `portal/app`                   |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/components.md:34
msgid ""
"Dependency direction: `app-frame` → `features/*/ui` → `{ui-kit, portal-sdk}` "
"→ shared. `ui-kit` must not import Habitat RPC / `rpc-contract`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ui/components.md:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Placement rules"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/ui/components.md:42
msgid ""
"If two features need the same interaction chassis, put the chassis in "
"**composite** (or structure/layout); keep field copy and domain types in the "
"feature."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/ui/components.md:42
msgid "Primitives stay dumb: variants and sizes, no feature imports."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/ui/components.md:42
msgid ""
"Composites take **capability props** (e.g. `useActionSheet: boolean`) or "
"call portal-sdk **interaction** hooks — they must not call `getShellKind()` "
"to choose ContextMenu vs ActionSheet."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: docs/ui/components.md:42
msgid ""
"Layout structure components may use **layout** APIs (`useCompactLayout`, "
"`useDrawerNav`, …)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: docs/ui/components.md:42
msgid ""
"Shell-only concerns stay in portal-sdk / shell host; ui-kit does not export "
"shell detectors."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/components.md:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Pending alignment:** Task-oriented views under `ui-kit/composite` (`TaskItemRowView`, …) are shared reference implementations. Prefer aligning new list modules to their **pattern contract** ([patterns.md](patterns.md)); extracting a generic `ListRow` is a follow-up task, not a license to fork row behavior.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ui/components.md:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "Which layer may read which dimension"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/components.md:55
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Layer              | Shell APIs                                                        | Layout APIs                                    | Interaction APIs                                 |\n"
"| ------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| Primitive          | No                                                                | No                                             | No (presentation only)                           |\n"
"| Structure / layout | No                                                                | Yes                                            | Rare (e.g. resize handles)                       |\n"
"| Composite          | Only via injected capability / portal-sdk helpers that hide shell | If the composite is a layout pattern           | Yes (menus, long-press, Enter-to-send consumers) |\n"
"| Domain             | Via portal-sdk when needed for capability UI                      | Yes for page chrome                            | Yes                                              |\n"
"| app frame          | Capability visibility                                             | Yes (primary)                                  | Yes where chrome needs it                        |\n"
"| Shell host         | Yes                                                               | Must not lock app layout from shell kind alone | Must not invent a parallel interaction model     |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ui/components.md:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "Primitive conventions (summary)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/components.md:67
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Need           | Prefer                                                                                       |\n"
"| -------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Button         | `<Button variant size>`                                                                      |\n"
"| Fields         | `<Input>` / `<Textarea>` / `<Select>`; no auto-focus by default (`focusOnMount` when needed) |\n"
"| Dialog / Sheet | Default `onOpenAutoFocus` blocked; override only when intentional                            |\n"
"| Loading        | `<Spinner>`                                                                                  |\n"
"| Empty          | `<EmptyState>`                                                                               |\n"
"| Status         | `<StatusAlert>`                                                                              |\n"
"| Confirm        | `<ConfirmDialog>` / `showConfirm` — never `window.confirm`                                   |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/components.md:69
msgid ""
"Full agent checklist → [`.agent/rules/frontend-ui.md`](../../.agent/rules/"
"frontend-ui.md)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ui/components.md:70
#, no-wrap
msgid "Dimension adaptation (components)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/components.md:79
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Lens        | Rule                                                                                   |\n"
"| ----------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Invariant   | Layer placement and import boundaries                                                  |\n"
"| Layout      | Structure components switch List-Detail / Modal-Sheet presentation; domain fills slots |\n"
"| Interaction | Composites branch on capability flags; shared menu item data (`ActionSheetItem[]`)     |\n"
"| Shell       | Capability availability only; never “Tauri ⇒ bottom tabs”                              |\n"
"| Forbidden   | Deep-importing feature sources from app-frame; ui-kit importing RPC                    |\n"
msgstr ""

